 elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6acbc8d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Anti-Splashing-Tape-300x212.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-2565\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Anti-Splashing-Tape-300x212.jpeg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Anti-Splashing-Tape-1024x723.jpeg 1024w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Anti-Splashing-Tape-768x542.jpeg 768w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Anti-Splashing-Tape.jpeg 1217w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f11a767 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f11a767\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2421643 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2421643\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-539d1e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"539d1e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Anti Splashing Tape</strong>, boru bağlantılarında, ek yerlerinde ve titreşimli yüzeylerde <em>sıvı sıçramasını</em>, <em>sızıntısını</em> ve <em>kirlenmeyi engellemek</em> için tasarlanmış yüksek performanslı sızdırmazlık bandıdır. Özellikle marin, endüstriyel ve denizcilik uygulamalarında kullanılır. Dayanıklı yapısı sayesinde uzun ömürlü koruma sağlar.</p><p>HD Marine Anti Splashing Tape, <strong>kolay uygulanabilir</strong>, <strong>su, yağ ve kimyasal sıçramalarına karşı dirençli</strong> bir çözümdür ve bakım gerektiren bağlantı noktalarında güvenli sızdırmazlık sağlar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-000dc4a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"000dc4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebaecd8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ebaecd8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab34fd8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ab34fd8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-359b97c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"359b97c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ürün Özellikleri</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b498f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0b498f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ <strong>Yüksek dirençli sızdırmazlık</strong> – Su, yağ, kimyasal sıçramalarına karşı korur<br />✔ <strong>Esnek ve dayanıklı yapı</strong> – Titreşim altında bile etkili performans<br />✔ <strong>Kolay uygulama</strong> – Bant şeklinde hızlı montaj<br /><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">✔</span> <strong>Geniş uyumluluk</strong> – Boru bağlantı elemanlarında, montaj yüzeylerinde<br />✔ <strong>Uzun ömürlü kullanım</strong> – Yıpranma ve deformasyona karşı dayanıklı</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-535c710 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"535c710\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnti Splashing Tape – Teknik Değerler\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e8d5f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8e8d5f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Ürün Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Sızdırmazlık ve sıçrama önleme bandı</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Malzeme</td><td width=\"329\">Elastomer / Polimer bileşik</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kalınlık</td><td width=\"329\">0,5 – 2,5 mm</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Genişlik</td><td width=\"329\">35 – 1000 mm</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Uzunluk</td><td width=\"329\">10 – 20 m (rulo)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">-20°C – +120°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kimyasal Direnç</td><td width=\"329\">Su, yağ, hafif solvent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Esneklik</td><td width=\"329\">Yüksek esneme ve dönüşümlü yüzey uyumu</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Uygulama Alanı</td><td width=\"329\">Boru bağlantıları, ek yerleri, endüstriyel yüzeyler</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7887cc5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7887cc5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca9b0e4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ca9b0e4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bec7511 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bec7511\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Kullanım Alanları</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b417b18 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b417b18\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Anti Splashing Tape, özellikle:</p><ul><li><strong>Boru ek yerleri ve bağ